    '5#ב': `But, etc. — since fowl in milk is rabbinic — Beit Yosef; Orach Chaim in name of R' Yitzchak permits without cleansing palate and netilat yadayim; explains tanna of wage per Tosafot there fowl then cheese — leniency in such case.`,
    '6#א': `Smoked. Yerushalmi Nedarim chapter 6 — Caesarea sages: smoked on Shabbat eve — basar b'chalav; but Shabbat chapter 7 one who roasts, fries, boils, smokes — all cooking; so too basar b'chalav — Peri Chadash.`,
    '6#ב': `And cooked, etc. — see there.`,
    '6#ג': `Or milk of dead animal — see there.`,
