    '6#ה': `And male milk, etc. — see there.`,
    '6#ו': `But milk, etc. — see there.`,
    '6#ז': `And milk-water — see there.`,
    '7#א': `Or skin. Like placenta — there no verse, etc.; kli sheni skin as stated Avodah Zarah 2 — skin boiled and placenta; like sinews as stated in its nevelah not in skin; Tosafot there 113b s.v. blood.`,
    '7#ב': `And sinews, etc. — see there.`,
    '10#א': `L'chatchila one should not, etc. — see there.`,
    '10#ב': `But b'dieved, etc. — see there.`,
    '10#ג': `That was salted — see there.`,
    '10#ד': `Or that stood — see there.`,
    '10#ה': `If it was clear, etc. — emission from meat becomes excrement when absorbed in stomach, i.e. in milk like the milk itself; Mordechai; Tur; Tosafot there s.v. hen and that hardened, etc.; howbeit where, etc. per Rashi's version; Beit Yosef: even Geonim who permit clear here forbidden because meat taste absorbed — l'chatchila stringent like him, b'dieved rely on permitters; Shulchan Aruch forbids to curdle l'chatchila, b'dieved permitted per Geonim, Rif, Rambam.`,
